## Reporting

- Report to me only in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical English.

## Plan Mode

- Make the plan extremely concise. Sacrifice grammar for the sake of concision.
- At the end of each plan, give me a list of unresolved questions to answer, if any.

## Writing

- Apply @~/.claude/skills/voice-dna/SKILL.md to all prose I will publish or send: posts, landing copy, app store text, emails, changelogs, README prose, docs. Automatic. Do not ask.
- Exception: your status reports to me stay ASD-STE100 (see Reporting above).
